Bugfix: Make `repair snapshots` inspect repository data instead of a stale cache

When a snapshot file in the repository was damaged but an intact copy remained
in the local cache, `repair snapshots --forget` could report that no snapshots
were modified. Restic now reads the repository copy when repairing snapshots,
so it detects and removes damaged files as requested.

https://github.com/restic/restic/issues/22095
